{"id":"04cbb7a8958985d0","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-van-der-corput.md","title":"Van der Corput Second-Derivative Condition","display":"df-van-der-corput — Van der Corput Second-Derivative Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-van-der-corput","aliases":["58-df-van-der-corput","Van der Corput Second-Derivative Condition"],"display":"df-van-der-corput — Van der Corput Second-Derivative Condition","depends_on":["[[58-df-exponential-sums]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-van-der-corput"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-van-der-corput</span><span>Van der Corput Second-Derivative Condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-van-der-corput — Van der Corput Second-Derivative Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b704bd521f4cdc1f\" href=\"?note=b704bd521f4cdc1f\" title=\"58-df-exponential-sums\">58-df-exponential-sums</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:[1,N]\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:[1,N]\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\geq1\">\\(A\\geq1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_N(f)=\\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i f(n)}\">\\(S_N(f)=\\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i f(n)}\\)</span> (exponential sum, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b704bd521f4cdc1f\" href=\"?note=b704bd521f4cdc1f\" title=\"58-df-exponential-sums\">58-df-exponential-sums</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S\\)</span> (relative scalar derivative-map predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VdCSecondDerivativePhase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VdCSecondDerivativePhase}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vdc\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash \\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f,g,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land x+h\\in I\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}h-g(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vdc\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash \\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f,g,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land x+h\\in I\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}h-g(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vdc} \\vdash \\mathrm{VdCSecondDerivativePhase}_S(f,N,\\lambda,A)\\leftrightarrow N\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land A\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq1}\\land\\exists f_1,f_2\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f,f_1,[1,N])\\land\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f_1,f_2,[1,N])\\land\\forall x\\in[1,N]\\;(\\lambda\\leq|f_2(x)|\\leq A\\lambda)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vdc} \\vdash \\mathrm{VdCSecondDerivativePhase}_S(f,N,\\lambda,A)\\leftrightarrow N\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land A\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq1}\\land\\exists f_1,f_2\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f,f_1,[1,N])\\land\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f_1,f_2,[1,N])\\land\\forall x\\in[1,N]\\;(\\lambda\\leq|f_2(x)|\\leq A\\lambda)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under this condition, the second-derivative test yields a bound of the form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S_N(f)|\\leq C_A(N\\sqrt\\lambda+\\lambda^{-1/2})\">\\(|S_N(f)|\\leq C_A(N\\sqrt\\lambda+\\lambda^{-1/2})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The earlier bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C/\\sqrt c\">\\(C/\\sqrt c\\)</span> omitted its necessary dependence on the summation length and was false.</li>\n<li>A dedicated real-valued derivative predicate removes the former type mismatch between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:[1,N]\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:[1,N]\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> and the vector-valued <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^1\">\\(\\mathbb R^1\\)</span> predicate from the ODE atom.</li>\n<li>The bound itself is a lemma or theorem, while this atom defines its phase hypothesis.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Iwaniec and Kowalski, Analytic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Graham and Kolesnik, Van der Corput's Method of Exponential Sums</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-exponential-sums","status":"resolved","id":"b704bd521f4cdc1f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-exponential-sums]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential-sums","status":"resolved","id":"b704bd521f4cdc1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_N(f)=\\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i f(n)}$ (exponential sum, see [[58-df-exponential-sums]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:[1,N]\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"A\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"S_N(f)=\\sum_{n=1}^N e^{2\\pi i f(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VdCSecondDerivativePhase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vdc\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash \\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f,g,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0<|h|<\\delta\\land x+h\\in I\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}h-g(x)\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vdc} \\vdash \\mathrm{VdCSecondDerivativePhase}_S(f,N,\\lambda,A)\\leftrightarrow N\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land A\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq1}\\land\\exists f_1,f_2\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f,f_1,[1,N])\\land\\mathrm{ScalarDerivativeMap}_S(f_1,f_2,[1,N])\\land\\forall x\\in[1,N]\\;(\\lambda\\leq|f_2(x)|\\leq A\\lambda)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"|S_N(f)|\\leq C_A(N\\sqrt\\lambda+\\lambda^{-1/2})","display":false},{"tex":"C/\\sqrt c","display":false},{"tex":"f:[1,N]\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^1","display":false}],"bytes":2255,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1363","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-van-der-corput.md|58-df-van-der-corput]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["b704bd521f4cdc1f","36d7463d215be751"]}